#: cli/doctor.php
#, php-format
msgid "Available repairs: %s"
msgstr "Pembaikan yang tersedia: %s"

#: cli/doctor.php
#, php-format
msgid "Unknown format %s. Use text, json, nagios, or prometheus."
msgstr "Format %s tidak diketahui. Gunakan text, json, nagios, atau prometheus."

#: cli/doctor.php
#, php-format
msgid "Redaction could not complete, so %s was not written."
msgstr "Penapisan maklumat sensitif tidak dapat diselesaikan, oleh itu %s tidak ditulis."

#: cli/doctor.php
#, php-format
msgid "Wrote %s. Review it before sharing; values after password, secret, token, and community names are masked."
msgstr "%s telah ditulis. Semak sebelum berkongsi; nilai selepas kata laluan, rahsia, token, dan nama komuniti telah disamarkan."

#: cli/doctor.php doctor_functions.php
msgid "Unknown repair"
msgstr "Pembaikan tidak diketahui"

#: cli/doctor.php
msgid "Refusing to repair without --yes."
msgstr "Enggan membaiki tanpa --yes."

#: cli/doctor.php
msgid "Select a supported symptom and text or JSON output."
msgstr "Pilih simptom yang disokong dan output text atau JSON."

#: cli/doctor.php doctor_web.php
msgid "Accepted warning"
msgstr "Amaran diterima"

#: doctor_access.php doctor_functions.php
msgid "Device availability"
msgstr "Ketersediaan peranti"

#: doctor_access.php
msgid "Device permissions could not be evaluated."
msgstr "Kebenaran peranti tidak dapat dinilai."

#: doctor_access.php
msgid "The configured PHP CLI cannot run Doctor checks."
msgstr "PHP CLI yang dikonfigurasikan tidak dapat menjalankan pemeriksaan Doctor."

#: doctor_access.php
msgid "Doctor checks failed or exceeded their time limit. Review the Doctor log."
msgstr "Pemeriksaan Doctor gagal atau melebihi had masanya. Semak log Doctor."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Graphs stopped updating"
msgstr "Graf berhenti dikemas kini"

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Polling is slow"
msgstr "Peninjauan perlahan"

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Devices are missing or unavailable"
msgstr "Peranti tiada atau tidak tersedia"

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Doctor alerts are missing"
msgstr "Amaran Doctor tiada"

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Check the poller scheduler and the affected poller log, then verify a new completed cycle."
msgstr "Semak penjadual poller dan log poller yang terjejas, kemudian sahkan kitaran baharu yang telah selesai."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Collection may have stopped."
msgstr "Pengumpulan mungkin telah berhenti."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Collected values may not be reaching disk."
msgstr "Nilai yang dikumpul mungkin tidak sampai ke cakera."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Inspect the output queue and Boost flush history; verify that the queue drains and RRD timestamps advance."
msgstr "Periksa baris gilir output dan sejarah pengosongan Boost; sahkan bahawa baris gilir telah dikosongkan dan cap masa RRD bergerak maju."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Check storage capacity, runtime-directory permissions and the last RRD update; account for deferred writes."
msgstr "Semak kapasiti storan, kebenaran direktori masa jalan, dan kemas kini RRD terakhir; ambil kira penulisan yang ditangguhkan."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "RRD storage needs investigation."
msgstr "Storan RRD perlu disiasat."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Collection work may be exceeding its time budget."
msgstr "Kerja pengumpulan mungkin melebihi bajet masanya."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Compare cycle duration with the polling interval and inspect device timeouts before increasing concurrency."
msgstr "Bandingkan tempoh kitaran dengan selang peninjauan dan periksa tamat masa peranti sebelum meningkatkan keserentakan."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Compare database counters during a slow cycle and inspect query plans before changing server limits."
msgstr "Bandingkan pembilang pangkalan data semasa kitaran perlahan dan periksa pelan kueri sebelum mengubah had pelayan."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Database pressure may be contributing to slow polling."
msgstr "Tekanan pangkalan data mungkin menyumbang kepada peninjauan yang perlahan."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Collection prerequisites or reachability may be failing."
msgstr "Prasyarat pengumpulan atau kebolehcapaian mungkin mengalami kegagalan."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Verify the affected device permissions, reachability, credentials and assigned poller using Cacti diagnostics."
msgstr "Sahkan kebenaran, kebolehcapaian, kelayakan peranti yang terjejas dan poller yang ditetapkan menggunakan diagnostik Cacti."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Scheduled checks or mail delivery need attention."
msgstr "Semakan berjadual atau penghantaran mel memerlukan perhatian."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Verify scheduling and recipient settings, inspect retained delivery attempts, and send a Cacti test email."
msgstr "Sahkan tetapan penjadualan dan penerima, periksa percubaan penghantaran yang disimpan, dan hantar e-mel ujian Cacti."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Possible causes require verification; matching checks do not establish a root cause."
msgstr "Punca yang berkemungkinan memerlukan pengesahan; semakan yang sepadan tidak membuktikan punca utama."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "No cause is established by the available observations. Run fresh diagnostics and investigate the symptom directly."
msgstr "Tiada punca dapat dipastikan daripada pemerhatian yang tersedia. Jalankan diagnostik baharu dan siasat simptom secara langsung."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "At least 24 hours since server startup and FLUSH STATUS. Counters are cumulative and may have different reset histories; confirm trends during a representative workload before tuning."
msgstr "Sekurang-kurangnya 24 jam sejak pelayan dimulakan dan FLUSH STATUS. Pembilang adalah kumulatif dan mungkin mempunyai sejarah tetapan semula yang berbeza; sahkan arah aliran semasa beban kerja yang mewakili sebelum membuat penalaan."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Cumulative tuning advice is deferred: obtain valid uptime and at least 24 hours since startup and FLUSH STATUS. Missing metrics or an inconsistent sample cannot establish database health."
msgstr "Nasihat penalaan kumulatif ditangguhkan: dapatkan masa hidup yang sah dan sekurang-kurangnya 24 jam sejak permulaan dan FLUSH STATUS. Metrik yang tiada atau sampel yang tidak konsisten tidak dapat memastikan kesihatan pangkalan data."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Database observation window"
msgstr "Tetingkap pemerhatian pangkalan data"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Connection metrics are unavailable or invalid. Check access to SHOW GLOBAL STATUS and SHOW GLOBAL VARIABLES; do not treat missing metrics as an idle server."
msgstr "Metrik sambungan tidak tersedia atau tidak sah. Semak akses kepada SHOW GLOBAL STATUS dan SHOW GLOBAL VARIABLES; jangan anggap metrik yang tiada sebagai pelayan yang melahu."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Current connections: %.0f / %.0f (%s); recorded peak: %.0f (%s of the current limit)."
msgstr "Sambungan semasa: %.0f / %.0f (%s); puncak direkodkan: %.0f (%s daripada had semasa)."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Review connection pooling and poller concurrency. Check database-host memory headroom before raising max_connections; the historical peak may reflect an older limit."
msgstr "Semak pengumpulan sambungan dan keserentakan poller. Semak ruang memori hos pangkalan data sebelum menaikkan max_connections; puncak sejarah mungkin mencerminkan had yang lebih lama."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Connection capacity"
msgstr "Kapasiti sambungan"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "InnoDB buffer pool reads"
msgstr "Bacaan kumpulan penimbal InnoDB"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Review query plans and the working set. Consider innodb_buffer_pool_size only after measuring memory available on the database host; a cumulative miss ratio alone does not prove memory pressure."
msgstr "Semak pelan kueri dan set kerja. Pertimbangkan innodb_buffer_pool_size hanya selepas mengukur memori yang tersedia pada hos pangkalan data; nisbah terlepas kumulatif sahaja tidak membuktikan tekanan memori."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "On-disk temporary tables"
msgstr "Jadual sementara pada cakera"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Review query plans, sorting, grouping, and temporary-table data types before changing memory limits. Some tables must use disk; memory limits and accounting differ between MySQL and MariaDB versions."
msgstr "Semak pelan kueri, pengisihan, pengumpulan, dan jenis data jadual sementara sebelum mengubah had memori. Sesetengah jadual mesti menggunakan cakera; had memori dan perakaunan berbeza antara versi MySQL dan MariaDB."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Connection thread creation"
msgstr "Penciptaan thread sambungan"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Review connection reuse and thread_cache_size. Check the server thread-handling mode before tuning; thread-pool implementations do not behave like one-thread-per-connection servers."
msgstr "Semak penggunaan semula sambungan dan thread_cache_size. Semak mod pengendalian thread pelayan sebelum membuat penalaan; pelaksanaan kumpulan thread tidak berkelakuan seperti pelayan satu thread setiap sambungan."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Review slow-query logging, long_query_time, and query plans before changing server buffers. This counter depends on the configured slow-query threshold and does not identify individual statements."
msgstr "Semak pengelogan kueri perlahan, long_query_time, dan pelan kueri sebelum mengubah penimbal pelayan. Pembilang ini bergantung pada ambang kueri perlahan yang dikonfigurasikan dan tidak mengenal pasti pernyataan individu."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Slow statements"
msgstr "Pernyataan perlahan"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Cumulative advice deferred until the observation window is sufficient."
msgstr "Nasihat kumulatif ditangguhkan sehingga tetingkap pemerhatian mencukupi."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Thread-cache advice is not assessed: thread_handling is unavailable or is not one-thread-per-connection. Review the active thread-pool implementation instead."
msgstr "Nasihat cache thread tidak dinilai: thread_handling tidak tersedia atau bukan satu thread setiap sambungan. Semak pelaksanaan kumpulan thread yang aktif sebaliknya."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Required counters are missing or invalid: %s, %s. Check server-version support and monitoring permissions."
msgstr "Pembilang yang diperlukan tiada atau tidak sah: %s, %s. Semak sokongan versi pelayan dan kebenaran pemantauan."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "A counter reset since the prior sample; collect another representative interval before tuning."
msgstr "Pembilang telah ditetapkan semula sejak sampel sebelumnya; kumpulkan selang wakil yang lain sebelum membuat penalaan."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Insufficient activity: %.0f %s; at least %d observations are needed for this advisory."
msgstr "Aktiviti tidak mencukupi: %.0f %s; sekurang-kurangnya %d pemerhatian diperlukan untuk nasihat ini."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Counters are inconsistent or were reset independently. Collect a new representative sample before tuning."
msgstr "Pembilang tidak konsisten atau ditetapkan semula secara bebas. Kumpulkan sampel wakil baharu sebelum membuat penalaan."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The interval sample is too small or counters reset; collect another representative interval before tuning."
msgstr "Sampel selang terlalu kecil atau pembilang ditetapkan semula; kumpulkan selang wakil yang lain sebelum membuat penalaan."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Interval %s / %s: %.0f / %.0f (%s); investigation threshold: %s."
msgstr "Selang %s / %s: %.0f / %.0f (%s); ambang siasatan: %s."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Cumulative %s / %s: %.0f / %.0f (%s); investigation threshold: %s."
msgstr "Kumulatif %s / %s: %.0f / %.0f (%s); ambang siasatan: %s."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "This counter can omit memory-mapped temporary files on MySQL; a low ratio does not rule out disk use."
msgstr "Pembilang ini boleh mengabaikan fail sementara dipetakan memori pada MySQL; nisbah yang rendah tidak menolak penggunaan cakera."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Redo-log advice deferred until the observation window is sufficient and Innodb_log_waits is available."
msgstr "Nasihat log ulang ditangguhkan sehingga tetingkap pemerhatian mencukupi dan Innodb_log_waits tersedia."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Cumulative Innodb_log_waits: %.0f."
msgstr "Kumulatif Innodb_log_waits: %.0f."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Investigate transaction sizes, log-buffer pressure, and storage latency. Recheck the rate under load before considering innodb_log_buffer_size; this historical count is not evidence of a current stall."
msgstr "Siasat saiz transaksi, tekanan penimbal log, dan kependaman storan. Semak semula kadar di bawah beban sebelum mempertimbangkan innodb_log_buffer_size; kiraan sejarah ini bukan bukti pegun semasa."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "InnoDB log-buffer waits"
msgstr "Penantian penimbal log InnoDB"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "installed Cacti composer.json"
msgstr "composer.json Cacti yang dipasang"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Cacti %s installer requirement"
msgstr "keperluan pemasang Cacti %s"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "PHP compatibility with installed Cacti"
msgstr "Keserasian PHP dengan Cacti yang dipasang"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Running PHP %s; installed Cacti %s."
msgstr "Menjalankan PHP %s; Cacti %s dipasang."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Could not establish Cacti's PHP requirement. Check the installed Cacti composer.json or release documentation; Doctor does not assume compatibility."
msgstr "Tidak dapat menentukan keperluan PHP untuk Cacti. Semak composer.json Cacti yang dipasang atau dokumentasi keluaran; Doctor tidak mengandaikan keserasian."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "PHP >= %s and < %s"
msgstr "PHP >= %s dan < %s"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "PHP >= %s"
msgstr "PHP >= %s"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Requires %s (%s). Running PHP meets that requirement."
msgstr "Memerlukan %s (%s). PHP yang sedang berjalan memenuhi keperluan tersebut."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Requires %s (%s). Running PHP does not meet that requirement."
msgstr "Memerlukan %s (%s). PHP yang sedang berjalan tidak memenuhi keperluan tersebut."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Detected %s; Doctor requires Cacti 1.2.20 or newer."
msgstr "Mengesan %s; Doctor memerlukan Cacti 1.2.20 atau lebih baharu."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Supported Cacti version"
msgstr "Versi Cacti yang disokong"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "PHP upstream security support"
msgstr "Sokongan keselamatan huluan PHP"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "This checks the PHP release branch, not whether this patch release is up to date or whether your OS vendor backports fixes. Cacti compatibility is checked separately."
msgstr "Ini menyemak cabang keluaran PHP, bukan sama ada keluaran tampung ini terkini atau sama ada vendor OS anda membuat pemindahan balik pembaikan. Keserasian Cacti disemak secara berasingan."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Running PHP %s; upstream security-support status is unknown or this is a prerelease. Check https://www.php.net/supported-versions.php and update Doctor's support data."
msgstr "Menjalankan PHP %s; status sokongan keselamatan huluan tidak diketahui atau ini ialah prakeluaran. Semak https://www.php.net/supported-versions.php dan kemas kini data sokongan Doctor."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Running PHP %s; PHP %s receives upstream security fixes through %s."
msgstr "Menjalankan PHP %s; PHP %s menerima pembaikan keselamatan huluan sehingga %s."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Running PHP %s; PHP %s no longer receives upstream security fixes; support ended %s. Upgrade to a supported PHP branch compatible with your Cacti installation, or confirm security maintenance with your OS vendor."
msgstr "Menjalankan PHP %s; PHP %s tidak lagi menerima pembaikan keselamatan huluan; sokongan tamat pada %s. Naik taraf kepada cabang PHP yang disokong dan serasi dengan pemasangan Cacti anda, atau sahkan penyelenggaraan keselamatan dengan vendor OS anda."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Required current CLI PHP extensions"
msgstr "Sambungan PHP CLI semasa yang diperlukan"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Required web PHP extensions"
msgstr "Sambungan PHP web yang diperlukan"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Missing: %s. Install them through the operating system package manager."
msgstr "Tiada: %s. Pasangkannya melalui pengurus pakej sistem pengendalian."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "All PHP extensions required by the Cacti installer are loaded in this PHP context."
msgstr "Semua sambungan PHP yang diperlukan oleh pemasang Cacti telah dimuatkan dalam konteks PHP ini."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Doctor does not execute configured binaries while running as root."
msgstr "Doctor tidak melaksanakan binari yang dikonfigurasikan semasa berjalan sebagai root."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "The file name %s is not expected for %s, so Doctor did not execute it."
msgstr "Nama fail %s tidak dijangka untuk %s, jadi Doctor tidak melaksanakannya."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Doctor is running as root, so permission checks describe root rather than the web server or poller account, configured binaries are not executed, and repairs are refused. Run Doctor as the Cacti poller user."
msgstr "Doctor sedang berjalan sebagai root, jadi semakan kebenaran menerangkan root dan bukannya akaun pelayan web atau poller, binari yang dikonfigurasikan tidak dilaksanakan, dan pembaikan ditolak. Jalankan Doctor sebagai pengguna poller Cacti."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Doctor privileges"
msgstr "Keistimewaan Doctor"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Doctor is running without root privileges."
msgstr "Doctor sedang berjalan tanpa keistimewaan root."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Required CLI PHP extensions"
msgstr "Sambungan PHP CLI yang diperlukan"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The configured PHP CLI executable is unavailable, so its extensions cannot be checked."
msgstr "Fail boleh laku PHP CLI yang dikonfigurasikan tidak tersedia, jadi sambungannya tidak dapat disemak."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "shell_exec() is disabled, so Doctor cannot compare the CLI PHP extensions with Cacti requirements."
msgstr "shell_exec() dilumpuhkan, jadi Doctor tidak dapat membandingkan sambungan PHP CLI dengan keperluan Cacti."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The configured PHP CLI executable did not return a valid extension list."
msgstr "Fail boleh laku PHP CLI yang dikonfigurasikan tidak mengembalikan senarai sambungan yang sah."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Missing from CLI PHP: %s. The web and CLI PHP configurations are separate on many systems."
msgstr "Tiada daripada PHP CLI: %s. Konfigurasi PHP web dan CLI adalah berasingan pada banyak sistem."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The configured PHP CLI has every extension required by Cacti."
msgstr "PHP CLI yang dikonfigurasikan mempunyai setiap sambungan yang diperlukan oleh Cacti."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "GD TrueType support"
msgstr "Sokongan GD TrueType"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Recommended PHP features"
msgstr "Ciri PHP yang disyorkan"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Unavailable: %s. Cacti can run without these features, but related functionality may be limited."
msgstr "Tidak tersedia: %s. Cacti boleh berjalan tanpa ciri ini, tetapi kefungsian berkaitan mungkin terhad."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The optional gettext, SNMP, and GD TrueType features are available."
msgstr "Ciri pilihan gettext, SNMP, dan GD TrueType tersedia."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "memory_limit is %s (%dM or more is recommended)"
msgstr "memory_limit ialah %s (%dM atau lebih disyorkan)"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "max_execution_time is %d seconds (60 or more is recommended)"
msgstr "max_execution_time ialah %d saat (60 atau lebih disyorkan)"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "date.timezone is not set"
msgstr "date.timezone tidak ditetapkan"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "unset"
msgstr "tidak ditetapkan"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s. Current values: %s"
msgstr "%s. Nilai semasa: %s"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "PHP runtime configuration"
msgstr "Konfigurasi masa jalan PHP"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Database connection"
msgstr "Sambungan pangkalan data"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Query failed: %s"
msgstr "Kueri gagal: %s"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "A read-only query completed successfully."
msgstr "Kueri baca sahaja berjaya diselesaikan."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The database returned an unexpected result."
msgstr "Pangkalan data mengembalikan keputusan yang tidak dijangka."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Doctor could not determine the database server version from %s."
msgstr "Doctor tidak dapat menentukan versi pelayan pangkalan data daripada %s."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Supported database server"
msgstr "Pelayan pangkalan data yang disokong"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s %s detected; this Cacti branch recommends %s %s or newer."
msgstr "%s %s dikesan; cabang Cacti ini mengesyorkan %s %s atau lebih baharu."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Database character set is %s and collation is %s. Cacti requires utf8mb4."
msgstr "Set aksara pangkalan data ialah %s dan kolasi ialah %s. Cacti memerlukan utf8mb4."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "unknown"
msgstr "tidak diketahui"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Database character set"
msgstr "Set aksara pangkalan data"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Database timezone support"
msgstr "Sokongan zon waktu pangkalan data"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The Cacti database account cannot read mysql.time_zone_name. Grant SELECT access and populate the database timezone tables."
msgstr "Akaun pangkalan data Cacti tidak dapat membaca mysql.time_zone_name. Berikan akses SELECT dan isi jadual zon waktu pangkalan data."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "The database timezone table is accessible and contains %d entries."
msgstr "Jadual zon waktu pangkalan data boleh diakses dan mengandungi %d entri."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The database timezone table is accessible but empty. Populate the system timezone tables."
msgstr "Jadual zon waktu pangkalan data boleh diakses tetapi kosong. Isi jadual zon waktu sistem."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Core tables used by Cacti are present."
msgstr "Jadual teras yang digunakan oleh Cacti wujud."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Missing core tables: %s. Restore or upgrade the database before attempting other repairs."
msgstr "Jadual teras tiada: %s. Pulihkan atau naik taraf pangkalan data sebelum mencuba pembaikan lain."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Core database tables"
msgstr "Jadual teras pangkalan data"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s is missing (%s)"
msgstr "%s tiada (%s)"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s is not writable (%s)"
msgstr "%s tidak boleh ditulis (%s)"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Runtime directories"
msgstr "Direktori masa jalan"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The cache, log, and RRA directories exist and are writable."
msgstr "Direktori cache, log, dan RRA wujud dan boleh ditulis."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Cacti configuration file"
msgstr "Fail konfigurasi Cacti"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "include/config.php is missing or unreadable."
msgstr "include/config.php tiada atau tidak boleh dibaca."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "include/config.php is readable. POSIX mode-bit checks do not apply on Windows."
msgstr "include/config.php boleh dibaca. Semakan bit mod POSIX tidak terpakai pada Windows."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "include/config.php is writable by other users. Remove world-write permission because this file contains database credentials."
msgstr "include/config.php boleh ditulis oleh pengguna lain. Alih keluar kebenaran tulis awam kerana fail ini mengandungi kelayakan pangkalan data."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "include/config.php is group-writable. Confirm that every member of the owning group is trusted."
msgstr "include/config.php boleh ditulis oleh kumpulan. Sahkan bahawa setiap ahli kumpulan pemilik dipercayai."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "include/config.php is readable by all local users and contains database credentials. Restrict it to the owner and the web server group."
